and why do we need a for loop?

Code
Please fill in the ____ that helps answer our question

for (i in 1:length(iris$Petal.Length)) {

  if (________________________) {
    print(________________________)
  }

}

Solution

iris$Petal.Size &lt;- NA

for (i in 1:nrow(iris)) {
  if (iris$Petal.Length[i] &gt; 4) {
    iris$Petal.Size[i] &lt;- "Large"
  } else {
    iris$Petal.Size[i] &lt;- "Small"
  }
}

